+        # Traktiva patch: Flow web app sends `resolution && resolution !== 1 ? [resolution] : undefined`,
+        # with its enum 1 = 720p, 2 = 1080p, 3 = 4K, 4 = 360p (Omni 360p, half the credits of 720p).
